WEBVTT

00:42.042 --> 00:46.504
YOUTH DOCUMENTARY
OUR BELOVED SUMMER

00:48.465 --> 00:50.258
Do you remember these two individuals

00:51.468 --> 00:54.262
from an early summer ten years ago?

00:56.806 --> 00:59.768
Kook Yeon-su really exhausts people.

00:59.851 --> 01:01.853
Why does she live such an exhausting life?

01:01.936 --> 01:04.981
Early birds just get tired earlier.

01:05.065 --> 01:07.859
What is he going to be when he grows up?

01:07.942 --> 01:09.861
We can sleep all we want when we're dead.

01:10.570 --> 01:13.406
I'm sure he's going to be lazy
his whole life.

01:13.490 --> 01:15.617
They were youthful 19 year-olds

01:15.700 --> 01:20.163
who garnered national attention
and birthed so many memes.

01:20.246 --> 01:21.664
Were they "loved" by people?

01:21.748 --> 01:23.416
I enjoyed watching it too.

01:24.000 --> 01:25.293
They were

01:26.002 --> 01:27.337
extremely immature.

01:27.420 --> 01:29.631
At first, I thought it was just Ung.

01:29.714 --> 01:33.384
But if you think about it,
Yeon-su seemed more immature.

01:33.468 --> 01:34.511
But to be honest,

01:35.345 --> 01:36.763
they're both a mess.

01:36.846 --> 01:37.806
Hey!

01:38.598 --> 01:41.017
Kook Yeon-su! You are crazy!

01:41.100 --> 01:42.060
Darn it!

01:50.360 --> 01:51.694
I thought you were a ghost!

01:54.114 --> 01:57.283
But in fact,
they weren't always bickering.

01:57.367 --> 02:00.870
They grew on each other
since they were always together.

02:01.538 --> 02:04.207
I could feel something else.

02:04.290 --> 02:06.000
You know what it is, right?

02:06.084 --> 02:08.419
That was what made it intriguing.

02:08.503 --> 02:10.964
MORNING, AN ALLEYWAY IN HWIYEONG-DONG

02:11.047 --> 02:12.340
You're three minutes late.

02:13.424 --> 02:14.509
Just three minutes?

02:14.592 --> 02:16.803
Three minutes is like
three years for us seniors.

02:17.470 --> 02:18.555
Don't be ridiculous.

02:18.638 --> 02:21.224
I now go to school
30 minutes earlier thanks to you.

02:21.307 --> 02:24.477
Exactly.
I'm helping you save a lot of time.

02:24.561 --> 02:27.313
Gosh, do we have
to walk to school together?

02:29.149 --> 02:30.233
Hey.

02:35.321 --> 02:36.489
No, thanks.

02:36.573 --> 02:39.033
This isn't from me. It's from my mom.

02:39.117 --> 02:42.078
Do you even have breakfast
if you go to school this early?

02:44.372 --> 02:45.456
Thanks.

02:47.458 --> 02:48.543
Hey.

02:49.294 --> 02:51.504
Did you borrow volume three as well?

02:51.588 --> 02:52.589
Yes.

02:53.256 --> 02:54.841
Can you just let me read in peace?

02:54.924 --> 02:56.634
I'm a speedy reader.

02:56.718 --> 02:58.553
Can you let me read it first?

03:00.763 --> 03:01.973
Maybe that's why

03:02.599 --> 03:05.768
many people are wondering
how they're doing.

03:05.852 --> 03:07.604
WILL WE GET TO SEE THEM AGAIN
AFTER 10 YEARS?

03:07.687 --> 03:11.733
I doubt it'll be easy
to get them in front of the camera again.

03:11.816 --> 03:13.568
A lot of time has passed.

03:13.651 --> 03:17.196
And as you know,
they were never that cordial.

03:17.280 --> 03:19.532
Now that I think about it,

03:19.616 --> 03:21.993
the atmosphere was very tense.
I know for a fact that

03:22.577 --> 03:23.703
they don't get along.

03:24.329 --> 03:25.705
Hey. Let's do a retake.

03:25.788 --> 03:27.999
I doubt it'll be easy.

03:28.082 --> 03:29.709
WHAT'S YOUR IDEAL TYPE?

03:29.792 --> 03:31.544
Someone who's very kind.

03:31.628 --> 03:35.089
A petite and adorable girl
with a round face.

03:35.173 --> 03:36.925
Someone who'll shower me with love.

03:37.008 --> 03:38.718
Someone with whom I can always be--

03:38.801 --> 03:40.511
How about just raising a dog?

03:41.554 --> 03:46.517
I'm certain that the man I like
will be someone really incredible.

03:48.770 --> 03:50.855
We spent that summer watching these two.

03:52.398 --> 03:54.567
How are they doing now?

03:54.651 --> 03:56.778
- Anyway…
- One thing I know for sure is that--

03:56.861 --> 03:59.322
…I won't have to see
this annoying face again.

04:00.281 --> 04:01.407
That's what I wanted to say.

04:38.319 --> 04:44.158
EPISODE 12
BEGIN AGAIN

04:58.673 --> 05:00.341
How did you first find out about it?

05:02.593 --> 05:03.928
Well…

05:05.221 --> 05:07.265
I can't remember that well.

05:09.600 --> 05:11.144
But I think I just did.

05:40.006 --> 05:41.758
The earliest memory I have

05:43.342 --> 05:46.262
is probably of that day.

05:47.764 --> 05:52.018
Every fall around this time, on this day,

05:54.687 --> 05:56.105
my parents

05:57.106 --> 06:00.568
always seemed very sad.

06:02.445 --> 06:05.073
I didn't know back then.

06:05.156 --> 06:06.699
I only found out later.

06:10.995 --> 06:14.373
That's when I began having those dreams.

06:17.960 --> 06:19.337
Dad.

06:21.089 --> 06:22.882
Dad, where are you?

06:22.965 --> 06:25.927
Dreams where I was abandoned repeatedly.

06:26.010 --> 06:27.053
Dad.

06:32.266 --> 06:33.184
In those dreams,

06:34.018 --> 06:37.230
I couldn't see the face of the person
I was looking for.

06:37.313 --> 06:38.773
- Hello.
- Welcome.

06:38.856 --> 06:40.149
Come on in.

06:42.944 --> 06:45.238
- Ung. Hello.
- Gosh.

06:45.321 --> 06:46.572
Come on in.

06:46.656 --> 06:49.033
Are you hungry? Would you like a hotteok?

06:49.117 --> 06:51.244
But I knew

06:51.327 --> 06:53.121
- that I wasn't looking for
- Wait here.

06:53.204 --> 06:55.373
- the parents I have now.
- Welcome.

07:00.586 --> 07:01.921
That's all.

07:03.381 --> 07:04.423
There's not much to it.

07:06.801 --> 07:10.972
I was lucky to have been adopted
by such great parents.

07:11.639 --> 07:12.807
Do they know?

07:13.891 --> 07:15.393
That I know?

07:16.936 --> 07:19.647
No. I didn't see the need to tell them.

07:26.362 --> 07:27.947
You must have been lonely.

07:34.036 --> 07:35.997
It must have broken your heart.

07:36.706 --> 07:39.000
How did you endure it all by yourself?

07:45.465 --> 07:47.633
I want to comfort you…

07:51.429 --> 07:53.681
but I don't know how.

07:57.268 --> 07:59.270
And I don't know what to say.

08:00.730 --> 08:01.939
You've already comforted me.

08:02.982 --> 08:04.400
What?

08:04.484 --> 08:07.487
You're here by my side
and listening to my story.

08:08.613 --> 08:09.822
That's enough.

08:24.629 --> 08:25.796
Are you leaving already?

08:27.131 --> 08:28.132
Don't worry.

08:29.342 --> 08:31.093
I'll leave once you fall asleep.

08:33.721 --> 08:34.847
Okay.

08:38.017 --> 08:40.770
I really have trouble sleeping.

08:41.479 --> 08:42.855
Yes.

08:43.648 --> 08:44.982
But strangely enough,

08:45.816 --> 08:47.568
I was able to sleep soundly…

08:50.530 --> 08:52.532
when you were by my side.

08:57.703 --> 08:58.829
Yeon-su.

09:25.106 --> 09:27.817
- Ho!
- Hey, Chang-sik.

09:27.900 --> 09:31.028
I thought you'd be back soon,
but you were closed for days.

09:31.112 --> 09:32.989
I was bored to death.

09:33.072 --> 09:37.910
Since we took some time off,
we decided to sightsee a bit.

09:37.994 --> 09:41.622
What's gotten into you?
You don't even close during the holidays.

09:41.706 --> 09:44.000
Just because. The weather was lovely.

09:44.083 --> 09:46.752
You should have taken me along with you.

09:46.836 --> 09:50.006
How could you go without me
when you knew I was alone?

09:50.089 --> 09:52.091
You hurt my feelings.

09:53.092 --> 09:54.260
Chang-sik.

09:54.927 --> 09:57.597
Kids nowadays use this term,

09:57.680 --> 09:59.515
"K.Y.P."

10:00.182 --> 10:01.559
What's that?

10:01.642 --> 10:06.355
It's short for "Know your place."

10:06.439 --> 10:08.399
I see. So?

10:10.401 --> 10:14.238
But you never stop butting in.

10:15.781 --> 10:19.577
- What do you mean?
- Gosh, you're so slow-witted.

10:19.660 --> 10:21.203
- Gosh.
- Mr. Choi.

10:21.287 --> 10:22.705
Hey, Ji-ung.

10:22.788 --> 10:24.915
- When did you return?
- We came back yesterday.

10:24.999 --> 10:27.710
Hold on. Are you already going to work?

10:27.793 --> 10:29.462
- No, I'm actually going home.
- What?

10:29.545 --> 10:31.839
I need to get changed and head back.

10:31.922 --> 10:33.382
- My gosh.
- Are you still filming?

10:33.466 --> 10:36.469
I didn't get much screen time lately.
Don't you need me?

10:36.552 --> 10:37.928
- Geez.
- We're done filming.

10:38.012 --> 10:41.515
- We had our final shoot a few days ago.
- Good work.

10:41.599 --> 10:44.977
I bet Ung was difficult to deal with.
Thanks for everything.

10:45.061 --> 10:47.063
But why in the world are you filming Ung?

10:47.146 --> 10:49.565
He's quiet and boring.

10:49.649 --> 10:51.859
I'm sure Ji-ung has his reasons.

10:51.942 --> 10:53.861
You really don't know your place.

10:53.944 --> 10:57.782
Do you have any idea
how popular my son is?

10:57.865 --> 11:00.242
I'm asking you. Do you?

11:00.326 --> 11:01.285
Answer me.

11:02.161 --> 11:05.414
Fine. You're so snappy.

11:06.540 --> 11:10.086
Ji-ung. Now that you're done,
what will you be filming next?

11:10.169 --> 11:12.296
If this is going to be aired on TV,

11:12.380 --> 11:15.424
you should film my hardware store

11:15.508 --> 11:19.136
and tell everyone
that we sell great tools.

11:19.220 --> 11:21.055
Gosh, why are you hitting me?

11:21.138 --> 11:22.681
Just ignore him.

11:22.765 --> 11:24.141
You must be tired. Go home.

11:24.225 --> 11:28.813
If you've been working until now,
does that mean you stayed up all night?

11:28.896 --> 11:30.564
No, I slept a bit at work.

11:30.648 --> 11:33.734
I'll let you know if I film
anything interesting again.

11:34.402 --> 11:36.153
- Okay.
- I should get going then.

11:36.237 --> 11:38.572
- Go on. Come by for a meal later today.
- I will.

11:38.656 --> 11:40.783
Okay. Bye.

11:40.866 --> 11:42.368
What a well-mannered kid.

11:43.035 --> 11:46.705
He sure is different from your son
when their names are so similar.

11:46.789 --> 11:47.748
You're still here?

11:54.004 --> 11:55.172
Hey, what is it?

11:56.882 --> 11:58.175
No, I'm fine.

11:59.635 --> 12:02.179
I just came home to get changed.

12:04.306 --> 12:06.559
No, have the meeting. I'll leave soon.

12:07.351 --> 12:08.352
Bye.

12:43.929 --> 12:46.015
Are you expecting a call from someone?

12:46.098 --> 12:47.475
What? No.

12:47.558 --> 12:50.436
Then hurry up and dig in.

12:50.519 --> 12:51.770
Fine.

13:07.620 --> 13:10.498
Watch out! It's dripping everywhere!

13:11.540 --> 13:12.791
Wasn't it my phone?

13:12.875 --> 13:13.876
No, it was mine.

13:17.838 --> 13:19.548
What's the matter with her?

13:21.008 --> 13:22.843
Grandma, I'm leaving now.

13:35.523 --> 13:38.859
I can call him first. It's not a big deal.

13:44.490 --> 13:46.492
What if he just fell asleep?

13:49.954 --> 13:52.915
Or maybe he's still up.

14:02.216 --> 14:03.300
What?

14:04.093 --> 14:05.344
Why are you here?

14:06.053 --> 14:06.971
When did you get here?

14:07.930 --> 14:09.014
You should have called.

14:09.890 --> 14:11.475
I was working. I just came.

14:12.226 --> 14:14.019
Do you usually go to work at this hour?

14:14.103 --> 14:16.355
I would have left sooner
had you told me you'd come.

14:17.022 --> 14:18.148
Did you get some sleep?

14:20.859 --> 14:22.403
No, I wasn't sleepy.

14:22.987 --> 14:26.657
You need to stop staying up
all night just because you're not sleepy.

14:26.740 --> 14:28.033
Have you been drinking jujube tea?

14:28.117 --> 14:29.869
You should still try to sleep.

14:29.952 --> 14:32.246
How can you sleep
when you're out and about?

14:32.329 --> 14:34.874
You're going to take
sleeping pills again, aren't you?

14:34.957 --> 14:38.460
I told you those pills
aren't good for you in the long run.

14:38.544 --> 14:40.629
You may not quit cold turkey,
but you should--

14:40.713 --> 14:41.630
Are you done?

14:43.257 --> 14:47.970
I'm just saying you should've stayed home
and tried to sleep.

14:49.013 --> 14:51.515
I'd rather be here right now.

14:53.767 --> 14:56.312
What's that face? Are you happy or not?

14:57.521 --> 14:58.689
I'm ecstatic.

14:59.899 --> 15:02.276
Then you should've just said so
from the get-go.

15:02.359 --> 15:04.069
Let's go. I'll drive you.

15:04.153 --> 15:06.488
To work? I can take the bus.

15:06.572 --> 15:08.115
It's quicker by car.

15:08.198 --> 15:10.326
You can't drive
when you haven't slept a wink.

15:10.409 --> 15:11.994
- That's--
- There you go again.

15:12.077 --> 15:15.080
Fine, but at least
let me drive you to the bus stop.

15:15.164 --> 15:16.498
Okay?

15:16.582 --> 15:18.208
Okay. That's fine.

15:19.376 --> 15:21.962
How can you nag me
every time I say something?

15:22.046 --> 15:24.256
It's only because you keep worrying me.

15:24.340 --> 15:25.257
I'm not a kid.

15:25.341 --> 15:27.384
Exactly. So when will you grow up, Ung?

15:38.729 --> 15:41.148
Then when will you grow up, Yeon-su?

15:46.862 --> 15:48.447
Can you skip work today?

15:50.783 --> 15:52.284
No way.

15:52.868 --> 15:55.287
Come on. Just one day will be fine.

15:55.371 --> 15:57.289
Work isn't like school. I can't do that.

15:57.373 --> 15:59.792
You don't need to drop me off.

15:59.875 --> 16:01.335
Just go home and sleep.

16:01.835 --> 16:03.671
But you said I could.

16:03.754 --> 16:06.006
I've changed my mind, so don't follow me.

16:11.720 --> 16:12.888
Ung.

16:13.514 --> 16:15.265
I have a question.

16:16.225 --> 16:17.559
Are we dating again?

16:18.435 --> 16:20.354
Did you think we weren't all this time?

16:21.063 --> 16:23.649
I mean, I just wanted to be sure.

16:25.067 --> 16:26.568
I thought it was obvious enough.

16:29.488 --> 16:30.531
Ung.

16:32.741 --> 16:34.827
I hope we get along.

16:38.831 --> 16:40.416
He's so straightforward.

16:42.167 --> 16:43.585
She's so adorable.

17:00.894 --> 17:04.106
- Stop staring.
- Do you have good news or something?

17:04.732 --> 17:06.650
- Why?
- I mean,

17:07.234 --> 17:11.864
you've been coming here to eat often,
which is rare for you.

17:13.615 --> 17:14.908
How was your trip?

17:14.992 --> 17:18.871
Good. We also enjoyed
the autumn leaves on our way home.

17:18.954 --> 17:20.456
We took a lot of photos too.

17:20.956 --> 17:22.082
Look.

17:23.333 --> 17:26.253
Look. Isn't it beautiful?

17:26.336 --> 17:28.047
Yes, it is.

17:28.130 --> 17:31.508
Resting for a few days
made me want to take a longer break.

17:32.134 --> 17:34.928
Should we just close down for good
and enjoy our free time?

17:35.012 --> 17:36.930
I've been telling you to do that.

17:37.014 --> 17:39.308
Just rest and live off your S.C.C.

17:39.975 --> 17:41.018
What is that?

17:41.894 --> 17:42.853
"Son's credit card."

17:43.937 --> 17:46.065
That sounds lovely.

17:48.901 --> 17:50.486
You should have taken me with you.

17:52.029 --> 17:53.489
To our trip?

17:53.572 --> 17:56.867
Well, you don't really like
visiting the countryside.

17:56.950 --> 17:58.827
And we thought you'd be busy.

18:00.496 --> 18:01.789
It's okay.

18:03.082 --> 18:05.584
I'm really fine,
so take me with you next time.

18:07.795 --> 18:09.797
Okay. We will.

18:11.298 --> 18:13.675
Hey, Ung.

18:14.176 --> 18:17.971
I heard you're done filming
the documentary.

18:18.055 --> 18:19.306
What do you say?

18:20.557 --> 18:25.312
Isn't it about time
you returned to being our cashier?

18:25.395 --> 18:30.025
Honey, Ung told me
to quit working and use my S.C.C.

18:30.901 --> 18:32.778
S.C.C? What is that?

18:32.861 --> 18:34.947
Do you not know?
It stands for "son's credit card."

18:35.030 --> 18:38.200
What? Hey, son. What about me?

18:38.283 --> 18:41.036
You should do something
that's even better and more popular.

18:41.120 --> 18:42.079
What is it?

18:42.162 --> 18:43.497
M.A.L.F.Y.

18:43.580 --> 18:45.124
M.A.L.F.Y…

18:45.207 --> 18:49.211
- Is that something better?
- Of course. It's much better.

18:49.711 --> 18:51.630
"Making a life for yourself."

18:54.007 --> 18:55.467
Thank you for the meal.

18:55.551 --> 18:57.177
- Come by for dinner too.
- "Making…"

18:57.261 --> 18:59.888
- I'll make dumpling soup.
- Don't tempt me with food.

18:59.972 --> 19:01.974
That's the only way I can bring you here.

19:04.017 --> 19:06.436
Hey, wait. "Making a…"

19:10.107 --> 19:12.234
- Mr. Park.
- Hey, Intern.

19:12.317 --> 19:15.237
- Where are your seniors?
- They're in a meeting with Ms. Lee.

19:15.904 --> 19:17.322
How was the shoot?

19:17.406 --> 19:19.992
We ended it with an interview of the cast.

19:20.784 --> 19:21.785
Well…

19:22.870 --> 19:23.912
What is it?

19:24.496 --> 19:27.249
It was strange.
They didn't even look at each other.

19:27.332 --> 19:28.834
No, not them.

19:28.917 --> 19:32.171
Did anything interesting happen?

19:32.254 --> 19:35.132
You know, with Chae-ran and Ji-ung.

19:35.215 --> 19:39.219
Please don't ask about them anymore.
I don't think this is right.

19:40.053 --> 19:43.640
- What did you say?
- And if this is because you think

19:43.724 --> 19:45.601
they have feelings for each other,

19:45.684 --> 19:47.436
then I definitely can't tell you anything.

19:47.519 --> 19:51.315
I don't think it's right
to suspect your colleagues like that.

19:51.398 --> 19:56.069
And why do you think something's going on
between Ms. Jung and Mr. Kim?

19:56.820 --> 19:59.239
They're hardworking people
who are only focused on…

20:00.866 --> 20:02.159
Ms. Jung.

20:04.536 --> 20:07.289
Is this what you've been up to lately?

20:08.624 --> 20:11.043
What do you mean? What's wrong?

20:13.587 --> 20:17.674
Oh, him? He always stands there
and rambles on like that.

20:17.758 --> 20:20.510
I thought he was just practicing
for some speech.

20:20.594 --> 20:22.638
- Why are you here anyway?
- Sorry?

20:22.721 --> 20:24.514
I was too lenient on you, wasn't I?

20:24.598 --> 20:28.310
I always let you go home on time,
but I guess you had nothing better to do.

20:28.393 --> 20:30.103
No, Ms. Jung. That isn't--

20:30.187 --> 20:31.980
I'm going to set you straight, Intern.

20:32.689 --> 20:34.274
No more going home for you.

20:35.776 --> 20:36.818
Hello?

20:36.902 --> 20:39.029
Ms. Jung, it's a misunderstanding.

20:39.112 --> 20:40.447
- Hello?
- Mr. Park.

20:40.530 --> 20:42.032
- Mr. Park.
- Yes?

21:05.764 --> 21:07.015
Are we ready?

21:07.099 --> 21:08.100
Yes, sir.

21:14.606 --> 21:18.193
Right. What was the last question again?

21:18.277 --> 21:20.195
"What will you be doing

21:20.279 --> 21:22.823
ten years from now?"

21:50.851 --> 21:52.978
- Ji-ung, are you okay?
- What do you mean?

21:53.061 --> 21:55.647
You didn't look well during the meeting.

21:55.731 --> 21:58.734
You've been pulling all-nighters recently,
so just go home tonight.

21:58.817 --> 22:01.153
- I'll wrap things up here.
- I'm fine.

22:02.279 --> 22:05.782
You really don't look fine.
I think you should go home.

22:05.866 --> 22:07.659
You could faint.

22:07.743 --> 22:09.786
It's better to faint here than at home.

22:10.495 --> 22:11.621
What?

22:12.331 --> 22:13.665
Never mind.

22:13.749 --> 22:16.835
I'll go home if I'm too exhausted,
so don't worry.

22:28.805 --> 22:31.683
Look. You're running a fever.

22:31.767 --> 22:32.809
This won't do. Get up.

22:32.893 --> 22:35.771
- I'm really fine.
- I'm kicking you out. Go.

22:35.854 --> 22:37.022
- Hey.
- Hurry.

22:37.105 --> 22:38.940
- Hey.
- Go on.

22:40.233 --> 22:42.444
I'm using this room tonight.
You can't come in.

22:43.320 --> 22:44.821
What? What's going on?

22:45.530 --> 22:49.534
Ji-ung's going home. He's running a fever
and might get us sick too.

22:49.618 --> 22:51.787
- It's not that bad.
- What is it?

22:52.662 --> 22:54.206
Is it a cold?

22:54.289 --> 22:55.874
Go home, okay?

22:55.957 --> 22:59.961
I suffered from a terrible flu last time.
Don't bother her, and just leave!

23:00.629 --> 23:02.172
Take care, then.

23:03.840 --> 23:06.176
Why is she overreacting all of a sudden?

23:07.010 --> 23:10.806
Don't you think
she's just worried about you?

23:10.889 --> 23:13.433
You're really slow-witted, aren't you?

23:13.517 --> 23:14.851
Just go home.

23:15.477 --> 23:16.394
Don't upset her.

23:16.978 --> 23:18.146
What do you mean?

23:20.899 --> 23:24.444
She hasn't been able to go home

23:24.528 --> 23:26.613
since you've been pulling
all-nighters here.

23:26.696 --> 23:29.950
I told her she could go home first.

23:30.033 --> 23:31.952
Is she still
walking on eggshells around me?

23:32.994 --> 23:35.080
Do you seriously think that's why?

23:36.790 --> 23:39.459
Forget it. You're a lost cause.

23:40.127 --> 23:41.211
How frustrating.

23:43.296 --> 23:44.256
So frustrating.

23:59.729 --> 24:00.981
This is terrible.

24:02.065 --> 24:03.733
Gosh.

24:24.004 --> 24:25.964
What's the matter with him now?

24:30.218 --> 24:31.511
Gosh, that's hot.

24:32.345 --> 24:35.891
Will you please focus?
We have so much to do.

24:37.475 --> 24:39.686
They published the interview
you did last time.

24:41.646 --> 24:43.523
Let's see.

24:43.607 --> 24:46.735
They want to use
some of your drawings for the documentary.

24:46.818 --> 24:50.197
Should I pick them out myself?
Or will you talk with Ji-ung about it?

24:51.781 --> 24:54.159
What? Give it some thought.

24:55.035 --> 24:58.371
By the way, I haven't seen him
since the shoot ended.

24:58.455 --> 24:59.539
He must be busy.

24:59.623 --> 25:01.666
Also, the gallery called.

25:01.750 --> 25:03.418
You wanted to see
the night lighting, right?

25:03.501 --> 25:05.712
They said you can come today.
Should we go?

25:05.795 --> 25:08.590
No. Not today.

25:09.174 --> 25:10.342
I have something to do.

25:11.009 --> 25:12.260
What? Drawing?

25:16.306 --> 25:19.017
Then Ye-in will be in charge
of the online marketing.

25:19.100 --> 25:20.310
Ji-un, please help her.

25:20.393 --> 25:21.770
- Okay.
- Okay.

25:21.853 --> 25:24.856
I think you've all become too lax
after finishing a big project.

25:24.940 --> 25:27.567
We still have
one more project left for this year.

25:27.651 --> 25:29.402
So let's focus on that.

25:29.486 --> 25:30.695
- Okay.
- Okay.

25:30.779 --> 25:33.031
Good work. That'll be all for today.

25:43.667 --> 25:46.586
Do you want to have dinner with me
after I get off work today?

25:52.092 --> 25:54.094
I left my pen behind.

26:04.771 --> 26:07.107
I can't today. Something came up.

26:07.190 --> 26:10.443
Seriously? Didn't he ask me
to skip work this morning?

26:12.946 --> 26:14.114
Is he upset?

26:16.032 --> 26:17.325
Why?

26:19.077 --> 26:20.287
What is it?

26:22.747 --> 26:24.040
Don't tell me you're upset--

26:26.751 --> 26:27.711
Okay.

26:44.060 --> 26:46.396
This house never feels welcoming.

26:52.152 --> 26:53.486
Just a second…

26:56.906 --> 26:58.783
I'll just rest for a minute.

27:20.138 --> 27:22.515
The person you have called…

27:50.794 --> 27:53.129
The person you have called…

28:16.820 --> 28:17.987
Why are you here?

28:18.696 --> 28:19.739
You have a fever.

28:27.163 --> 28:28.498
It isn't that bad.

28:29.958 --> 28:33.336
Right. It doesn't seem that bad.

28:34.379 --> 28:35.505
When did you get here?

28:35.588 --> 28:36.798
A while ago.

28:37.465 --> 28:39.968
I had just looked up
how to medicate someone who's sleeping.

28:40.593 --> 28:42.470
Oh, well. Take this.

28:49.436 --> 28:52.897
Why does your house feel so empty?

28:54.482 --> 28:55.775
You know I live here, right?

28:58.778 --> 29:00.155
Why are you sick?

29:03.491 --> 29:05.034
What kind of a question is that?

29:05.118 --> 29:07.954
I mean, you've always been proud
of how healthy you were.

29:08.037 --> 29:09.914
So I can't help but feel curious.

29:10.999 --> 29:13.918
What did you do to get sick like this

29:14.002 --> 29:16.129
and throw a pity party?

29:18.173 --> 29:19.257
Nothing much.

29:20.341 --> 29:22.427
I just pulled
a few all-nighters. That's all.

29:23.428 --> 29:24.971
I'm going back to bed.

29:25.054 --> 29:26.431
I won't see you out.

29:35.398 --> 29:37.233
You must have
something you want to tell me.

29:38.693 --> 29:39.861
I do.

29:41.362 --> 29:42.405
But…

29:43.281 --> 29:46.701
I'm not sure if I should
since you're sick right now.

30:01.591 --> 30:03.593
Can I not hear it if I don't want to?

30:04.886 --> 30:06.846
Yeon-su and I are dating again.

30:09.390 --> 30:11.434
I guess I had no choice.

30:15.897 --> 30:18.650
So? Why are you telling me this?

30:20.985 --> 30:23.780
Because, just like when we were young,

30:24.364 --> 30:26.699
I wanted you to be the first to know.

30:31.704 --> 30:33.915
I got a girlfriend.

30:38.336 --> 30:39.879
And just like then

30:41.089 --> 30:42.465
I have nothing to say to you.

30:45.844 --> 30:47.428
Should I congratulate you?

30:49.806 --> 30:50.765
No, that's okay.

30:53.226 --> 30:54.477
If you're done,

30:56.271 --> 30:58.898
- can I go back to sleep?
- Yes.

31:04.195 --> 31:05.363
One more thing.

31:05.446 --> 31:06.573
Yes?

31:07.824 --> 31:09.492
Can you please get lost?

31:11.619 --> 31:12.912
Okay.

31:48.740 --> 31:50.033
Hello?

31:50.116 --> 31:51.910
Hey, are you up?

31:51.993 --> 31:52.952
Yes.

31:54.495 --> 31:57.749
I woke up a while ago.
I'm about to go out.

31:58.750 --> 32:00.335
And you? Did you not sleep again?

32:00.418 --> 32:02.045
No, I slept a bit.

32:05.048 --> 32:08.468
Right. Did you have breakfast yet?

32:08.551 --> 32:10.136
Have some breakfast and go to bed.

32:10.803 --> 32:11.888
Okay.

32:13.348 --> 32:14.682
Are you going to work?

32:14.766 --> 32:16.684
Yes, I am.

32:17.268 --> 32:18.311
I see.

32:18.394 --> 32:19.646
That's right.

32:23.274 --> 32:25.735
Well, what are you doing this weekend?

32:25.818 --> 32:27.195
This weekend?

32:27.278 --> 32:28.780
Yes, this weekend.

32:29.364 --> 32:31.157
Do you want to hang out if you're free?

32:31.240 --> 32:33.785
Let's see. This weekend…

32:33.868 --> 32:35.912
If you're too busy, then it's okay.

32:35.995 --> 32:39.874
No. I'm free this weekend. Let's meet.

32:40.583 --> 32:41.793
Okay, then.

32:43.086 --> 32:44.379
All right, then.

32:44.462 --> 32:47.799
I should go to work now. I'm hanging up.

32:48.383 --> 32:49.509
Okay.

32:53.179 --> 32:55.807
Why does this feel so awkward?

32:57.767 --> 33:00.269
Just be yourself, Yeon-su.

33:00.979 --> 33:03.940
Darn it.
Maybe I shouldn't have asked to meet.

33:09.946 --> 33:12.156
Gosh. It feels so awkward.

33:16.160 --> 33:17.704
What are you doing?

33:19.539 --> 33:21.332
- What?
- Aren't you going to work?

33:21.416 --> 33:24.419
I am. I was just about to leave.

33:33.302 --> 33:36.055
She's acting like she's caught some bug.

33:36.764 --> 33:37.890
Hold on.

33:38.725 --> 33:40.268
Maybe I did too.

33:49.360 --> 33:51.738
I haven't talked to her
on the phone for so long.

33:51.821 --> 33:53.114
Should I call her again?

33:53.781 --> 33:55.158
No.

33:57.452 --> 33:59.912
What is this? A water park?

34:01.914 --> 34:03.541
My gosh!

34:04.125 --> 34:06.836
Where's your head at?
Are you still half asleep?

34:07.628 --> 34:10.089
This will be a pain to clean up.
Good luck.

34:10.173 --> 34:13.051
- Hey, can you clean this up?
- What? But…

34:14.343 --> 34:15.636
I didn't come here to clean.

34:15.720 --> 34:17.138
Come on.

34:17.221 --> 34:19.724
I'm your manager, not your servant!

34:20.975 --> 34:24.854
I did ask him out first,
but he didn't seem that elated.

34:24.937 --> 34:27.899
It didn't seem like
he was too excited to get back together.

34:27.982 --> 34:29.525
So? Did he refuse to see you?

34:29.609 --> 34:31.527
No, it's not that.

34:32.028 --> 34:33.946
But it keeps bothering me.

34:34.030 --> 34:36.532
It's as if I forced him
to hang out with me.

34:36.616 --> 34:37.992
But you are seeing him.

34:38.076 --> 34:40.995
Did you expect him to jump for joy?

34:41.079 --> 34:43.122
You're not teenagers anymore, you know?

34:43.206 --> 34:46.000
Still. It's not like him
to react that way.

34:46.084 --> 34:48.252
He's definitely changed. It's weird.

34:48.336 --> 34:50.546
Do you know what I find
the weirdest right now?

34:50.630 --> 34:51.714
What?

34:51.798 --> 34:54.592
The fact that you called me first.

34:55.343 --> 34:59.764
You made the effort to call me
during work hours.

35:00.598 --> 35:02.975
I'm not working right now. I'm driving.

35:03.059 --> 35:05.478
You used to be a rude brat

35:05.561 --> 35:07.772
who'd tell me to be brief
whenever I called you.

35:08.356 --> 35:12.944
But you called me first,
and you're rambling on about Ung.

35:13.528 --> 35:15.655
Well, that's because--

35:15.738 --> 35:18.116
Okay. Who do you think has changed?

35:18.699 --> 35:21.077
Who's the weirdest one here?

35:21.744 --> 35:25.039
Anyway, stop worrying over
things like that. Just follow your heart.

35:25.123 --> 35:27.542
It took you long enough
to get back together.

35:27.625 --> 35:31.337
So can you please stop hesitating
and step up already? I'm hanging up.

35:31.420 --> 35:34.382
Goodness. I can't believe I said that.

35:34.465 --> 35:37.051
Hang up! Can you please hang up?

35:39.846 --> 35:41.222
Gosh, that felt great.

35:41.764 --> 35:43.891
What an adorable, little brat.

35:43.975 --> 35:46.686
Gosh, why have I become so timid?

35:49.981 --> 35:52.483
Has dating always been this difficult?

36:03.202 --> 36:04.412
What did she want?

36:04.495 --> 36:06.372
Ung and Yeon-su are going out again.

36:06.455 --> 36:07.957
Are you serious?

36:11.127 --> 36:14.672
Why did they go through all that
if they were going to get back together?

36:19.677 --> 36:21.679
- How do you feel?
- What?

36:21.762 --> 36:25.057
I know you don't really like him.

36:25.141 --> 36:27.393
Gosh, my opinion doesn't matter.

36:27.476 --> 36:29.729
She likes him, so what can I say?

36:31.439 --> 36:34.358
That boy looks so sickly.

36:35.026 --> 36:36.903
I'm sure he's fine.

36:37.945 --> 36:40.907
But I am worried about his mental health.

36:42.241 --> 36:43.242
He's a bit…

36:44.368 --> 36:48.414
Never mind. Anyway, I'll keep
an eye on them. Don't you worry.

36:49.999 --> 36:53.169
Or should I introduce her
to a few more men?

36:53.252 --> 36:57.798
There are many wonderful candidates.

36:58.466 --> 37:01.677
No, it's okay. Don't bother. Let her be.

37:01.761 --> 37:02.887
Have this.

37:04.013 --> 37:05.056
It's fine.

37:05.139 --> 37:06.432
You must like him.

37:06.515 --> 37:09.727
Not at all. Why would I like
that good-for-nothing?

37:10.311 --> 37:12.355
Then take your time.

37:13.105 --> 37:15.149
I should find her a good man

37:15.233 --> 37:17.777
before I get any older and croak.

37:18.402 --> 37:20.112
I don't have much time.

37:21.822 --> 37:24.075
I have to see him again.

37:24.158 --> 37:26.827
The building is quite huge
and there are many shops around here.

37:29.413 --> 37:32.333
- Is it three stories tall?
- Yes.

37:36.254 --> 37:40.132
It'd be nice if you give
this area a lot of exposure.

37:40.841 --> 37:43.469
The sunset looks beautiful from up here.

37:43.552 --> 37:45.012
Okay. I'll let them know.

37:45.096 --> 37:46.681
Do you have any other requests?

37:46.764 --> 37:50.434
I'm sure you'll do a great job.

37:51.143 --> 37:52.687
Let me check the time.

37:53.271 --> 37:55.106
You'll be able to see the sunset.

37:55.189 --> 37:57.024
Take a look around with your colleague.

37:57.108 --> 37:59.902
I'm here alone today.
I'll come by with them again next time.

37:59.986 --> 38:03.072
What? I thought you came with him.

38:05.533 --> 38:07.159
He's been here for a while.

38:08.619 --> 38:10.121
- Ma'am.
- Yes?

38:27.096 --> 38:28.514
I had forgotten…

38:44.196 --> 38:45.698
What are you doing here?

38:46.866 --> 38:48.409
…who I was in love with.

38:49.618 --> 38:51.162
Are you here to see me?

38:53.039 --> 38:55.750
Why did you want to meet on the weekend?

38:56.959 --> 38:58.127
What?

38:59.337 --> 39:00.504
I can't wait

39:01.630 --> 39:02.590
that long.

39:03.591 --> 39:06.302
Whether he changed or not doesn't matter.

39:06.886 --> 39:08.888
Get back to work. I won't get in your way.

39:10.931 --> 39:12.600
I didn't know about this place.

39:13.434 --> 39:15.770
I could hold my exhibition here someday.

39:22.651 --> 39:23.652
It was Ung.

39:24.153 --> 39:26.447
I just loved him for who he was.

39:34.955 --> 39:37.500
It won't take long.
Just wait a little while.

39:45.925 --> 39:47.009
I was right.

39:48.219 --> 39:49.720
The weekend was too far away.

39:59.980 --> 40:00.940
This way.

40:09.782 --> 40:11.951
There's an exhibition hall upstairs.

40:25.339 --> 40:27.383
EDITING ROOM

40:37.184 --> 40:39.895
Ji-ung, are you sure
you're feeling better?

40:39.979 --> 40:43.107
Yes. You took my temperature earlier.

40:44.650 --> 40:46.777
Did something good happen?

40:48.487 --> 40:49.613
No.

40:55.327 --> 40:57.079
Can we use a different insert?

40:57.163 --> 40:59.748
Yes, we can. I'll find you one.

41:03.919 --> 41:05.087
Thank you.

41:17.600 --> 41:19.351
HOT AND SAVORY ROASTED CHESTNUTS

41:34.700 --> 41:35.951
This feels like

41:36.577 --> 41:38.412
we're on a date today.

41:42.333 --> 41:45.836
It finally feels like
we're going out again.

41:50.591 --> 41:51.884
It took a long time,

41:52.968 --> 41:53.844
didn't it?

42:05.856 --> 42:07.399
Darn these corn dogs.

42:09.610 --> 42:11.820
- Can you hold this for me?
- No.

42:12.488 --> 42:13.614
Okay, then.

42:35.344 --> 42:36.887
- Do you want a corn dog?
- Okay.

42:42.184 --> 42:44.061
- Let's go.
- This looks tasty.

42:45.729 --> 42:47.565
BEGIN AGAIN

42:51.777 --> 42:53.070
Mr. Kim.

42:54.321 --> 42:56.532
What was that? You just saw me.

42:56.615 --> 42:59.410
- Were you just going to walk by?
- What brings you here?

42:59.493 --> 43:01.537
You know I'm doing a special documentary.

43:02.997 --> 43:04.999
Is Mr. Choi done with his documentary?

43:05.082 --> 43:08.043
How's it going?
I'm really looking forward to it.

43:08.127 --> 43:10.337
We're done shooting,
and we're editing now.

43:10.921 --> 43:12.590
Are you going to use my footage too?

43:13.215 --> 43:15.342
By the way,
is Mr. Choi very busy these days?

43:15.426 --> 43:18.345
Is he still busy even after the shoot,

43:18.429 --> 43:20.347
or is he just pretending to be?

43:21.056 --> 43:22.725
I just can't seem to reach him.

43:33.402 --> 43:35.404
Don't tell me that's your dinner.

43:36.155 --> 43:38.449
That won't fill you up. Chi-seong.

43:38.532 --> 43:40.367
Goodbye. Yes?

43:40.451 --> 43:41.535
Am I done for today?

43:41.619 --> 43:44.121
Yes. I thought
you were going to head home.

43:44.204 --> 43:47.499
I'm going to have dinner with him.

43:47.583 --> 43:48.917
Just you two?

43:49.501 --> 43:52.004
What do you say?
I have some stuff to ask you anyway.

43:52.588 --> 43:55.132
I was just going to have
a light meal while editing.

43:56.300 --> 43:57.885
Are you that busy?

43:59.178 --> 44:01.013
Well…

44:04.558 --> 44:05.684
Now, tell me.

44:07.186 --> 44:09.313
Explain the look
on your face from earlier.

44:09.396 --> 44:10.439
What look?

44:10.522 --> 44:13.275
When I said I couldn't reach Mr. Choi,

44:14.652 --> 44:16.820
this was how you looked at me.

44:18.364 --> 44:19.740
That's just how I look.

44:19.823 --> 44:22.743
That's not true. I definitely saw it.

44:24.953 --> 44:26.997
What is it? Tell me.

44:27.081 --> 44:28.916
Has word got out
that Mr. Choi rejected me?

44:33.170 --> 44:35.756
It seems like
you're the one telling people.

44:36.340 --> 44:39.593
Then do they all know that
we're acting like the rumors are true?

44:40.260 --> 44:42.930
You're the first person to tell me this.

44:43.806 --> 44:46.475
Then do they also know
that Mr. Choi likes Ms. Kook?

44:48.018 --> 44:49.520
I guess they do.

44:51.021 --> 44:52.648
Could he not hide it better?

44:53.774 --> 44:54.942
You knew?

44:55.025 --> 44:57.319
They'll soon know
that the feeling is mutual.

44:59.655 --> 45:01.407
You know a lot of things.

45:03.742 --> 45:05.327
Do you want anything else?

45:05.411 --> 45:07.955
Ma'am, can we get
a bottle of beer and soju?

45:08.038 --> 45:08.956
Coming right up.

45:09.039 --> 45:11.375
That's for me. You can order your own.

45:13.252 --> 45:15.254
We can't be sober for this kind of talk.

45:19.633 --> 45:22.511
How did you know that I'd be there?

45:22.594 --> 45:25.681
Ye-in from your team told me.

45:26.306 --> 45:28.392
Why did you contact her?

45:28.475 --> 45:30.102
She contacted me first.

45:30.185 --> 45:31.270
Why?

45:31.895 --> 45:35.190
She was the only person
who asked if the scandal was true.

45:36.150 --> 45:38.318
Oh, that.

45:43.449 --> 45:47.744
I'm sure you already know,
but it was a false report.

45:53.041 --> 45:56.003
Interesting, right?
All because I know a celebrity.

45:59.423 --> 46:01.049
- But…
- Yes?

46:01.717 --> 46:04.178
- …the photos were real.
- What?

46:05.262 --> 46:08.432
I didn't know you were close enough
to go over to her house.

46:09.224 --> 46:11.768
Hold on. I'm sure you could tell
from the photos,

46:11.852 --> 46:13.645
but I didn't actually go inside the house.

46:13.729 --> 46:15.939
Well, they can't take photos
of inside the house.

46:16.023 --> 46:19.651
It's true. I was invited but I declined.

46:20.444 --> 46:21.904
She invited you?

46:22.988 --> 46:26.074
She also invited Eun-ho, I think.

46:26.158 --> 46:28.744
So she invited you over to her place.

46:28.827 --> 46:31.330
Is that important right now?

46:32.080 --> 46:36.043
Well, it wasn't before.
But I'm not so sure now.

46:36.627 --> 46:37.628
Hey.

46:43.091 --> 46:46.428
- We're here.
- If you go now, things will be awkward.

46:47.012 --> 46:47.971
Hey.

46:49.181 --> 46:51.683
Look at you standing
in front of a woman's house again.

46:51.767 --> 46:52.684
Hey.

46:52.768 --> 46:55.103
Is this a new habit you picked up?
You've changed.

46:55.187 --> 46:56.438
That's enough.

46:57.648 --> 47:00.817
- Do you know what I hate right now?
- What?

47:00.901 --> 47:02.528
We're not students anymore.

47:04.029 --> 47:06.281
You don't have to go home so early.

47:07.991 --> 47:09.368
Come back outside.

47:15.624 --> 47:16.917
Come here.

47:17.000 --> 47:18.669
It's too early to go home.

47:18.752 --> 47:20.379
No. You can't go.

47:22.381 --> 47:24.132
Who is that?

47:24.716 --> 47:25.884
Is that you, Yeon-su?

47:28.345 --> 47:32.558
Who in the world
is still out at this hour?

47:42.901 --> 47:43.944
Would you like…

47:47.573 --> 47:50.284
- to come over for some jujube tea?
- What?

47:50.367 --> 47:51.952
I'm serious.

47:52.035 --> 47:54.204
I want to get rid of…

47:54.288 --> 47:55.330
I mean…

47:56.331 --> 47:57.791
Let's have some together.

48:02.170 --> 48:04.256
Pick it up. It's okay.

48:18.020 --> 48:21.898
Or do you want to go see something lame?

48:24.067 --> 48:27.446
I saw it coming,

48:27.529 --> 48:31.033
so I wasn't that shocked.

48:47.007 --> 48:48.133
The thing is,

48:49.009 --> 48:52.721
I didn't see any harm in having a crush

48:53.513 --> 48:55.349
since I never had one before.

48:55.891 --> 48:57.726
But now that I do,

48:57.809 --> 49:00.437
I feel motivated every morning

49:00.520 --> 49:04.191
and I become hopeful
over the smallest things.

49:05.067 --> 49:08.111
It makes me feel really special.

49:10.572 --> 49:14.534
On top of that,
my imagination started going wild.

49:14.618 --> 49:16.912
I even thought of becoming
a writer because of that.

49:16.995 --> 49:19.915
I thought that was my calling.

49:22.250 --> 49:25.962
This all came to me
after I started having a crush on him.

49:27.673 --> 49:30.092
So how great is that?

49:42.479 --> 49:43.480
No.

49:43.980 --> 49:45.691
To be honest, it sucks.

49:45.774 --> 49:48.527
How could he make me feel so miserable?

49:52.072 --> 49:54.658
I feel like a worthless person

49:54.741 --> 49:57.953
who came in between their precious love.

49:59.454 --> 50:01.248
Do you get what I mean?

50:07.129 --> 50:09.673
This is so wrong. I give up on my crush.

50:13.427 --> 50:15.470
I take back what I just said.

50:16.930 --> 50:17.931
I know.

50:19.808 --> 50:21.059
Know what?

50:22.811 --> 50:24.104
That I can't give up on him?

50:27.357 --> 50:28.775
So annoying.

50:28.859 --> 50:31.361
What? Don't get me wrong.

50:31.445 --> 50:36.283
I'm not talking about you.
I'm talking about this lousy situation.

50:42.497 --> 50:43.790
It gets better.

50:46.585 --> 50:48.044
Having a crush on someone

50:49.629 --> 50:51.256
is hard at first.

50:51.757 --> 50:53.341
After a while,

50:54.426 --> 50:55.761
it gets even worse.

50:57.137 --> 50:58.096
Then…

50:59.473 --> 51:01.433
it becomes unbearable.

51:02.434 --> 51:03.602
But after that…

51:05.812 --> 51:07.439
you get used to it.

51:08.607 --> 51:11.443
Does that mean I'll be able to give up?

51:12.486 --> 51:13.445
No.

51:15.697 --> 51:19.201
You get used to the pain

51:20.577 --> 51:22.454
that you eventually become numb…

51:24.664 --> 51:28.168
and you get used to the heartache.

51:31.922 --> 51:33.048
Then…

51:35.550 --> 51:37.677
when does it stop?

51:40.514 --> 51:41.890
Well…

51:46.603 --> 51:47.979
I haven't thought of that.

51:49.564 --> 51:53.109
Having a crush is so miserable.

51:59.783 --> 52:01.451
Thank you

52:01.535 --> 52:04.412
for helping me come to my senses.

52:14.840 --> 52:18.218
The gallery at this hour? Isn't it closed?

52:18.301 --> 52:19.761
It won't take long.

52:23.139 --> 52:24.933
What? You have the key card?

52:29.813 --> 52:30.897
Do you want to come in?

52:42.492 --> 52:45.620
Is this where you'll be holding
your solo exhibition?

52:45.704 --> 52:46.580
Yes.

52:48.790 --> 52:52.127
I forgot what a great artist you were,

52:52.210 --> 52:53.211
Mr. Choi.

52:55.881 --> 52:59.342
But why did you have to come
and check at this hour?

52:59.968 --> 53:03.346
I'm thinking of holding
a nighttime exhibition.

53:03.430 --> 53:04.514
Late at night?

53:04.598 --> 53:07.434
Yes. It'll last throughout the night.

53:08.810 --> 53:12.606
I doubt many people will come
if it's too late.

53:12.689 --> 53:14.816
Promoting your exhibition
won't be easy either.

53:14.900 --> 53:17.277
That's why my idea keeps getting rejected.

53:18.737 --> 53:22.532
Artists really do think differently
than us regular people.

53:23.742 --> 53:25.160
But why at this hour?

53:26.536 --> 53:29.748
Because it's when I drew them.

53:29.831 --> 53:30.999
Plus…

53:32.876 --> 53:35.003
it's when I'm always awake.

54:23.718 --> 54:24.844
Just now,

54:26.262 --> 54:29.599
I imagined the time you spent awake
alone at this hour.

54:31.267 --> 54:32.769
It must have been lonely.

54:36.356 --> 54:39.442
What goes through your mind
when you're drawing?

54:43.863 --> 54:45.198
What do you think about

54:46.616 --> 54:49.452
during that long period of time?

54:52.747 --> 54:53.581
I'm not sure.

54:54.916 --> 54:56.459
I never really thought about it.

54:59.254 --> 55:03.049
But I couldn't have imagined
anything as perfect as this.

55:14.394 --> 55:17.731
Every thin line that I drew…

55:19.315 --> 55:20.567
Every second

55:21.735 --> 55:23.028
that went by…

55:31.369 --> 55:32.871
Every year…

55:37.542 --> 55:38.918
Every moment…

55:41.588 --> 55:44.841
Yeon-su was always there.

55:48.595 --> 55:49.721
What did you imagine?

55:51.431 --> 55:52.932
And continuously…

56:00.899 --> 56:02.442
I will spend all of my time

56:10.992 --> 56:13.119
loving Kook Yeon-su.

56:29.636 --> 56:30.845
Let's go home.

56:32.847 --> 56:33.681
Okay.

57:14.139 --> 57:21.146
EPILOGUE

57:29.696 --> 57:32.115
If there's an end to this crush,

57:33.700 --> 57:35.910
I hope it's now.

58:07.442 --> 58:10.111
Your fever's down. I'm leaving now.

58:10.195 --> 58:12.280
I told you to leave earlier.

58:16.951 --> 58:18.745
What now? Do you have something to say?

58:22.957 --> 58:25.585
Hey, do you want to move in with me?

58:25.668 --> 58:26.794
What?

58:26.878 --> 58:31.424
Your place feels somewhat lonely.

58:33.468 --> 58:35.011
Cut the nonsense and go already.

58:35.595 --> 58:36.638
Thank goodness.

58:37.430 --> 58:39.265
I was worried you'd say yes.

58:40.808 --> 58:41.893
Rest up.

58:42.477 --> 58:44.687
You should always sleep at home.

58:45.438 --> 58:47.649
And that includes my place too.

58:52.487 --> 58:54.489
I'm sick and tired of…

58:57.116 --> 59:00.328
always being the bad guy.

59:03.206 --> 59:10.213
BEGIN AGAIN

59:30.858 --> 59:34.195
I want to keep living in this world.

59:34.821 --> 59:38.199
Because misfortune always comes
disguised as happiness.

59:38.283 --> 59:39.701
It's nothing.

59:40.702 --> 59:42.829
Let's just ignore it.

59:44.038 --> 59:45.373
I'm not going to be friends with you.

59:45.456 --> 59:47.875
How are you going to end it?

59:47.959 --> 59:50.420
But Ji-ung… Why aren't you looking at me?

59:51.379 --> 59:53.631
I just don't get
why you're seeing Yeon-su again.

59:54.299 --> 59:56.884
They say couples who fight
and break up often…

59:56.968 --> 59:59.012
What are you doing, Yeon-su?

59:59.095 --> 01:00:01.014
…have a higher chance
of breaking up again.

01:00:04.684 --> 01:00:09.689
Subtitle translation by: Soo-ji Kim
